t("Stalk", "Acechar", "talent name")
t("#F53CBE#You are having trouble focusing on your prey!", "¡Tienes problemas para concentrarte en tu presa!", "logPlayer")
t("Harass Prey", "Harass Presión", "talent name")
t("#F53CBE#%s's %s is disrupted!", "#F53CBE# %s 's %s es interrumpido!", "logSeen")
t("Beckon", "Llamar", "talent name")
t("Surge", "o", "talent name")

t("When you focus your attacks on a single foe and strike them in melee for two consecutive turns, your hatred of them overcomes you and you begin to stalk them with single-minded purpose. The effect will last for %d turns, or until your prey is dead. Stalking gives you bonuses against your foe that grow each turn you hit them, and diminish each turn you don't.\n\t\tBonus level 1: +%d Accuracy, +%d%% melee damage, +%0.2f hate/turn prey was hit\n\t\tBonus level 2: +%d Accuracy, +%d%% melee damage, +%0.2f hate/turn prey was hit\n\t\tBonus level 3: +%d Accuracy, +%d%% melee damage, +%0.2f hate/turn prey was hit\n\t\tThe accuracy bonus improves with your Willpower, and the melee damage bonus with your Strength.", "Cuando concentras tus ataques en un solo enemigo y lo golpeas en combate cuerpo a cuerpo durante dos turnos consecutivos, tu odio hacia él te supera y comienzas a acecharlo con un propósito único. El efecto durará %d turnos, o hasta que tu presa esté muerta. Acechar te da bonificaciones contra tu enemigo que crecen cada turno que lo golpeas, y disminuyen cada turno que no lo haces.\\n\\t\\tNivel de bonificación 1: +%d Precisión, +%d%% daño cuerpo a cuerpo, +%0.2f odio/turno que la presa fue golpeada\\n\\t\\tNivel de bonificación 2: +%d Precisión, +%d%% daño cuerpo a cuerpo, +%0.2f odio/turno que la presa fue golpeada\\n\\t\\tNivel de bonificación 3: +%d Precisión, +%d%% daño cuerpo a cuerpo, +%0.2f odio/turno que la presa fue golpeada\\n\\t\\tLa bonificación de precisión mejora con tu Voluntad, y la bonificación de daño cuerpo a cuerpo con tu Fuerza.", "tformat")
t("Harass your stalked victim with two quick attacks for %d%% (at 0 Hate) to %d%% (at 100+ Hate) damage each. Each attack that scores a hit disrupts one talent, rune or infusion for %d turns. Your opponent will be unnerved by the attacks, reducing the damage they deal by %d%% for %d turns.\n\n\t\tThis talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.", "Hostiga a tu víctima acechada con dos ataques rápidos por %d%% (a 0 Odio) a %d%% (a 100+ Odio) de daño cada uno. Cada ataque que acierte interrumpe un efecto beneficioso del objetivo.", "tformat")
t("The connection between predator and prey allows you to speak to the mind of your target and beckon them closer. For %d turns, they will try to come to you, even pushing others aside to do so. They will move towards you instead of acting %d%% of the time, but can save verses Mindpower to slow the effect. If they take significant damage, the beckoning may be overcome altogether. The effect makes concentration difficult for your target, reducing Spellpower and Mindpower by %d until they reach you.\n\t\tThe Spellpower and Mindpower reduction increases with your Willpower.", "La conexión entre depredador y presa te permite hablar con la mente de tu objetivo y atraerlo. Durante %d turnos, intentará acercarse a ti, incluso si eso significa entrar en peligro.", "tformat")
t("Let hate fuel your movements. While active, you gain %d%% movement speed. The recklessness of your movement brings you bad luck (Luck -3).\n\t\tCleave, Repel and Surge cannot be active simultaneously, and activating one will place the others in cooldown.\n\t\tSustaining Surge while Dual Wielding grants %d additional Defense.\n\t\tMovement speed and dual-wielding Defense both increase with the Willpower stat.", "Deja que el odio alimente tus movimientos. Mientras estás activo, tú ganas la velocidad del movimiento %d %%. La imprudencia de tu movimiento te trae mala suerte (Luck -3).\nCleave, Repel y Surge no pueden ser activos simultáneamente, y activar uno colocará a los otros en en enfriamiento.\nSostenimiento de Surge mientras Dual Wielding otorga %d Defensa adicional.\nLa velocidad de movimiento y la defensa dual aumentan con el puesto de Willpower.", "tformat")
